#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:5
msgid "Title block properties section"
msgstr "图框属性部分"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:7
msgid ""
"The title block section from the `folio properties`_ is the section used to "
"define the `title block`_ template used at the `folio`_. The folio variables"
" can also be managed from this section."
msgstr ""
"`图幅属性 <folio properties_>`_ 中的图框部分用于定义该 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 所使用的 `图框 <title "
"block_>`_ 模板。图幅变量也可以在此部分中管理。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:12
msgid ""
"To reduce the creation time, QElectroTech allows creating some pre-setting "
"for all future folios that will be created in the project. The folio "
"variable values and the `folio title block`_ can be predefined at the "
"project properties. For more information about how to pre-define folio "
"properties, refer to `project properties`_ section."
msgstr ""
"为缩短创建时间，QElectroTech 允许为将在项目中创建的所有未来图幅预设一些内容。图幅变量值和 `图幅图框 <folio title "
"block_>`_ 可以在项目属性中预定义。有关如何预定义图幅属性的更多信息，请参阅 `项目属性 <project properties_>`_ 一节。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:17
msgid ""
"The title block section is organized on three different areas: title block "
"selection area, main variable tab and custom variable tab."
msgstr "图框部分分为三个不同的区域：图框选择区、主变量标签页和自定义变量标签页。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:21
msgid "Title block selection area"
msgstr "图框选择区域"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:23
msgid ""
"The title block selection area is used to define the `folio title block`_. "
"The actions that can be managed from this section are:"
msgstr "图框选择区域用于定义 `图幅图框 <folio title block_>`_ 。可在此部分中执行的操作包括："

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:26
msgid ""
"Select the `folio title block`_ from the `project title block collection`_."
msgstr ""
"从 `项目图框集合 <project title block collection_>`_ 中选择 `图幅图框 <folio title "
"block_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:27
msgid ""
"Select the position of the title block in the folio, bottom |titleblock-"
"bottom| or right |titleblock-right| side."
msgstr "选择图框在图幅中的位置：底部 |titleblock-bottom| 或右侧 |titleblock-right| 一侧。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:40
msgid "titleblock-bottom"
msgstr "图框底部"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:41
msgid "titleblock-right"
msgstr "图框右侧"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:28
msgid ""
"Edit the `title block`_ pressing the button |edit-rename| and choosing the "
"option **Edit this template**."
msgstr ""
"按下按钮 |edit-rename| 并选择选项 **Edit this template** ，以编辑 `图框 <title block_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:42
msgid "edit-rename"
msgstr "编辑并重命名"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:29
msgid ""
"Duplicate the `title block`_ in the `project title block collection`_ "
"pressing the button |edit-rename| and choosing the option **Duplicate and "
"edit this template**."
msgstr ""
"在 `项目图框集合 <project title block collection_>`_ 中按下按钮 |edit-rename| 并选择选项 "
"**Duplicate and edit this template** ，以复制 `图框 <title block_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:34
msgid "Figure: Folio title block selection area"
msgstr "图：图幅图框选择区域"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:38
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech title block, refer to `title block`_"
" section."
msgstr "有关 QElectroTech 图框的更多信息，请参阅 `图框 <title block_>`_ 部分。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:45
msgid "Main folio properties tab"
msgstr "主图幅属性标签页"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:47
msgid "The **Main** tab provides these default folio variables."
msgstr "**Main** 标签页提供以下默认图幅变量。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:52
msgid "Figure: Folio title block main tab"
msgstr "图：图幅图框主标签页"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:54
msgid "The default folio variables are:"
msgstr "默认图幅变量包括："

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:56
msgid "**Title**: Title from the folio."
msgstr "**Title**: 图幅的标题。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:57
msgid "**Author**: Author from the folio."
msgstr "**Author**: 图幅的作者。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:58
msgid "**Date**: Date of creation of the folio."
msgstr "**Date**: 图幅的创建日期。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:59
msgid "**File**:"
msgstr "**文件**:"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:60
msgid "**Folio**: Folio information (Label)."
msgstr "**Folio**: 图幅信息（标签）。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:61
msgid "**Plant**: Folio variable named Plant."
msgstr "**Plant**: 名为 Plant 的图幅变量。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:62
msgid "**Location**: Folio variable named Location."
msgstr "**Location**: 名为 Location 的图幅变量。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:63
msgid "**Rev index**: Revision index from the folio."
msgstr "**Rev index**: 图幅的修订索引。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:64
msgid "**Page Num**: Auto numbering pattern from the folio."
msgstr "**Page Num**: 图幅的自动编号模式。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:68
msgid ""
"For more information about default variables, refer to `variables`_ section."
msgstr "有关默认变量的更多信息，请参阅 `变量 <variables_>`_ 一节。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:71
msgid "Custom properties folio tab"
msgstr "自定义属性图幅标签页"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:73
msgid ""
"The **Custom** tab is the section where custom variables can be defined."
msgstr "**Custom** 标签页是可定义自定义变量的部分。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:78
msgid "Figure: Folio title block custom tab"
msgstr "图：图幅图框自定义标签页"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:80
msgid "To define a user folio variable:"
msgstr "要定义用户图幅变量："

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:82
msgid "Define variable name at the **Name** column from the variables table."
msgstr "在变量表的 **Name** 列中定义变量名称。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_title_block.rst:83
msgid ""
"Define variable value at the **Value** column from the variables table."
msgstr "在变量表的 **Value** 列中定义变量值。"
